      "anchorMode": "board-fixed-size",
      "solution": {
        "version": 1,
        "title": "Q14 · A ⇌ B → C, exact solution",
        "problem": "$k_1=0.120$, $k_{-1}=0.0300$, $k_2=0.0450$ s$^{-1}$; $[A]_0=0.500$ M. (a) $t$ and value of $[B]_{max}$ (b) $t$ when $[C]=0.250$ M. No steady-state approximation.",
        "steps": [
          {
            "id": "q14-sol-s01",
            "math": "\\lambda^2-0.195\\lambda+0.0054=0",
            "note": "Decay constants of M = [[−k₁, k₋₁], [k₁, −(k₋₁ + k₂)]]: λ₊ + λ₋ = k₁ + k₋₁ + k₂, λ₊λ₋ = k₁k₂."
          },
          {
            "id": "q14-sol-s02",
            "math": "\\lambda=\\frac{39\\pm3\\sqrt{73}}{400}",
            "note": "λ₊ ≈ 0.16158 s⁻¹, λ₋ ≈ 0.03342 s⁻¹."
          },
          {
            "id": "q14-sol-s03",
            "math": "\\frac{d}{dt}\\left(\\frac{0.06}{\\frac{6\\sqrt{73}}{400}}\\left(e^{-\\frac{39-3\\sqrt{73}}{400}t}-e^{-\\frac{39+3\\sqrt{73}}{400}t}\\right)\\right) = 0.12\\cdot\\frac{0.5}{\\frac{6\\sqrt{73}}{400}}\\left(\\left(0.12-\\frac{39-3\\sqrt{73}}{400}\\right)e^{-\\frac{39+3\\sqrt{73}}{400}t}+\\left(\\frac{39+3\\sqrt{73}}{400}-0.12\\right)e^{-\\frac{39-3\\sqrt{73}}{400}t}\\right)-0.075\\cdot\\frac{0.06}{\\frac{6\\sqrt{73}}{400}}\\left(e^{-\\frac{39-3\\sqrt{73}}{400}t}-e^{-\\frac{39+3\\sqrt{73}}{400}t}\\right)",
            "note": "CAS check that [B](t) = k₁[A]₀(e^(−λ₋t) − e^(−λ₊t))/(λ₊ − λ₋) and the matching [A](t) satisfy d[B]/dt = k₁[A] − (k₋₁ + k₂)[B]."
          },
          {
            "id": "q14-sol-s04",
            "math": "\\frac{d}{dt}\\left(\\frac{0.5}{\\frac{6\\sqrt{73}}{400}}\\left(\\left(0.12-\\frac{39-3\\sqrt{73}}{400}\\right)e^{-\\frac{39+3\\sqrt{73}}{400}t}+\\left(\\frac{39+3\\sqrt{73}}{400}-0.12\\right)e^{-\\frac{39-3\\sqrt{73}}{400}t}\\right)\\right) = -0.12\\cdot\\frac{0.5}{\\frac{6\\sqrt{73}}{400}}\\left(\\left(0.12-\\frac{39-3\\sqrt{73}}{400}\\right)e^{-\\frac{39+3\\sqrt{73}}{400}t}+\\left(\\frac{39+3\\sqrt{73}}{400}-0.12\\right)e^{-\\frac{39-3\\sqrt{73}}{400}t}\\right)+0.03\\cdot\\frac{0.06}{\\frac{6\\sqrt{73}}{400}}\\left(e^{-\\frac{39-3\\sqrt{73}}{400}t}-e^{-\\frac{39+3\\sqrt{73}}{400}t}\\right)",
            "note": "… and d[A]/dt = −k₁[A] + k₋₁[B]."
          },
          {
            "id": "q14-sol-s05",
            "math": "\\frac{\\ln\\left(\\frac{39+3\\sqrt{73}}{39-3\\sqrt{73}}\\right)}{\\frac{6\\sqrt{73}}{400}} \\approx 12.2959",
            "note": "(a) d[B]/dt = 0 at t_max = ln(λ₊/λ₋)/(λ₊ − λ₋), in s."
          },
          {
            "id": "q14-sol-s06",
            "math": "\\frac{0.06}{\\frac{6\\sqrt{73}}{400}}\\left(e^{-\\frac{39-3\\sqrt{73}}{400}\\cdot12.2959}-e^{-\\frac{39+3\\sqrt{73}}{400}\\cdot12.2959}\\right) \\approx 0.24621",
            "note": "[B]max in M."
          },
          {
            "id": "q14-sol-s07",
            "math": "500\\left(1-\\frac{\\frac{39+3\\sqrt{73}}{400}e^{-\\frac{39-3\\sqrt{73}}{400}\\cdot27.4910}-\\frac{39-3\\sqrt{73}}{400}e^{-\\frac{39+3\\sqrt{73}}{400}\\cdot27.4910}}{\\frac{6\\sqrt{73}}{400}}\\right) \\approx 250.0",
            "note": "(b) [C](t) = [A]₀(1 − (λ₊e^(−λ₋t) − λ₋e^(−λ₊t))/(λ₊ − λ₋)) equals 250.0 mM at t = 27.491 s."
          },
          {
            "id": "q14-sol-s08",
            "math": "\\frac{\\ln 2}{\\frac{0.120\\cdot0.0450}{0.0300+0.0450}} \\approx 9.627",
            "note": "Contrast: the steady-state k_eff = k₁k₂/(k₋₁ + k₂) = 0.072 s⁻¹ would predict 9.63 s. Invalid: B builds up to half of [A]₀."
          }
        ],
        "answer": "t_{max}=12.3\\ \\mathrm s,\\ [B]_{max}=0.246\\ \\mathrm M;\\quad t\\left([C]=0.250\\ \\mathrm M\\right)=27.5\\ \\mathrm s",
        "source": {
          "kind": "manual"
        }
      }
    },
